// expect: refuse E_EffectMismatch
// Checkpointing a branch writes its image to a file, so `!Filesystem` over a
// function that installs the disk policy refuses. Through boot 2b5b0c6d the
// policy's arms wrote the wire through the implementation function, past the
// Filesystem op, so the install's row carried no Filesystem and this
// declaration checked clean over a write to /tmp.
import persist

fn checkpoint(x) with !Filesystem = persist_branch(() => x * 2) |> join_persist ~> persist_to_disk

fn main() = 0
